sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant U as unary()
participant D as TrendDetector
participant T as _tail: _TrendWindow
participant B as _reference: _TrendWindow
U->>D: construct fresh instance
loop each finite value in input order
    U->>D: update(value)
    D->>D: validate and normalize value
    D->>T: append(centered)
    opt sample leaves tail
        T-->>D: expired value
        D->>B: append(expired)
    end
    alt windows not ready
        D-->>U: TrendResult(ready=false)
    else windows ready
        D->>B: fit()
        D->>T: fit()
        Note over D: Slope delta, displacement, noise and inertia give evidence
        opt score reaches qualification threshold
            D->>D: _breakpoint()
        end
        D-->>U: TrendResult(score, ready, horizontal, event)
    end
    Note over U: Store score if ready, otherwise None
end
